                        "Queries & Accessors — Read-only &self methods [library]",
                        "Output & Display — Formatters, serialization [library]",
                        "Constructor Tests — Verify construction creates correct state [demo-test]",
                        "Builder Tests — Verify builder configuration methods [demo-test]",
                        "Transition Tests — Verify state transitions and validation [demo-test]",
                        "Query Tests — Verify post-transition accessors [demo-test]",
                        "Identity Tests — Verify PRAGMA/METADATA integrity [demo-test]",
                        "Error Tests — Verify error Display and conditions [demo-test]",
