                    "why_reserved": "Library BODY sections follow type_lifecycle ordering — identity → traits → creation → operation → observation → output → free functions. This ordering presumes a TYPE to have a lifecycle. bare-bone hasn't committed to being a library yet. Including library-specific sections is premature form commitment.",
